<title>FRANCE: Publicis 1996 sales up seven percent.</title>
<headline>Publicis 1996 sales up seven percent.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>(All figures in billions of French francs)</p>
<p>    Turnover					21.9	vs   20.5</p>
<p>NOTE - Publicis said in a statement the sales would have been six percent higher on a constant structure and unchanged exchange rates basis. It said the sales rise confirmed its forecast of higher 1996 profits.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
